    "process": "Runtime six-file complete storage chain committed568e0276. Companion selects only seven qualified policy files, not pending histogram/staging/report features. Two archived invalid generator proposals withdrawn by exact identities: original31\u219229, seven active owners; independent SMP remains1/12,11open.",
