    "open": "Exact old regression hardware cause unresolved. Retained rejected routing source, all adverse rows and denial stay separate from accepted runtime. Single cohort is not universal/stable speedup or causal RSS proof. Full remote CI, arbitrary native death/reentry misuse, general CFFI, generational GC and whole SMP remain outside this REV."
